{
  "_readme": [
    "Company job boards this workspace will search when a job search does not name",
    "specific companies. This is a starting point, not an authority: every entry is",
    "probed against the live Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby API before it is used, and any",
    "entry the API does not recognise is skipped with a note on the search run.",
    "",
    "Edit this file to point the search at the companies you actually care about,",
    "or set COMPANY_BOARDS_FILE to a file of your own.",
    "",
    "Each entry: {\"company\": \"Display Name\", \"platform\": \"greenhouse|lever|ashby\",",
    "\"token\": \"the board identifier in the board URL\"}.",
    "",
    "To find a token, open a company's careers page and look at the URL:",
    "  https://boards.greenhouse.io/<token>   https://jobs.lever.co/<token>",
    "  https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/<token>"
  ],
